sequenceDiagram
    actor Developer
    participant IDEShell
    participant ProjectManager
    participant ArtifactStore
    participant TestService
    participant AnalysisManager
    participant DynAnalyser

    Developer->>IDEShell: Run Tests
    IDEShell->>ProjectManager: active_project
    ProjectManager-->>IDEShell: Project
    IDEShell->>ArtifactStore: list_for_project(Project)
    ArtifactStore-->>IDEShell: artifacts
    IDEShell->>TestService: run_tests(Project, artifacts)
    TestService-->>IDEShell: TestRunResult
    IDEShell->>IDEShell: render test results
    IDEShell->>AnalysisManager: run_dynamic_analysis_from_tests(TestRunResult)
    AnalysisManager->>DynAnalyser: analyse_test_results(TestRunResult)
    DynAnalyser-->>AnalysisManager: AnalysisResult
    AnalysisManager-->>IDEShell: dynamic diagnostics
    IDEShell->>IDEShell: render diagnostics
